clared\nsecular, that is, devoid of any particular religious doctrine; as a result, complete disregard will be shown towards religion. Citizens will be free to act arbitrarily, and they will not respect the monastery,\nshakha, and guru. A bull standing on one leg is an indication that the rules of religion"
